  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Modern Energy Cooking Services Clean Cooking Research Study - Cox&apos;s Bazar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conduct an&#x202F;assessment of cooking technologies utilized in host communities in Cox&apos;s Bazar District, evaluate the benefits of integrating E-Cooking appliances with solar systems and mini-grids, and aim to improve access to renewable electricity, reduce energy costs, and promote sustainable cooking practices, enhancing the&#x202F;quality of life in communities lacking reliable grid electricity and offer clean cooking alternatives to traditional methods in peri-urban and rural households.</narrative>
  </description>
